0reversal%20with%20important%20ecological%2C%20public%20health%2C%20and%20democratic%20implications%20for%20communities%20across%20Cornwall.%E2%8F%B8%EF%B8%8F%20Pause%20on%20rollout%20-%20The%20planned%20commencement%20of%20chemical%20weed%20treatment%20%28scheduled%20for%20May%202026%29%20will%20be%20paused%20until%20a%20meaningful%20public%20consultation%20has%20taken%20place.%F0%9F%93%A3%20Public%20consultation%20%26amp%3B%20opt-out%20extension%20-%20The%20Council%20acknowledged%20that%20the%20three-week%20opt-out%20window%20for%20parish%20and%20town%20councils%20was%20inadequate%20%28and%20included%20the%20Easter%20period%29.%20This%20will%20now%20be%20extended%20to%20%2A%2A30%20days%20following%20publication%20of%20the%20consultation%20results%2A%2A.%F0%9F%93%98%20Clearer%20guidance%20-%20Clearer%20guidance%20will%20be%20provided%20to%20town%20and%20parish%20councils%20on%20the%20minimum%20required%20standards%20of%20the%20urban%20network.%F0%9F%92%B7%20Review%20of%20financial%20terms%20-%20An%20urgent%20review%20will%20be%20undertaken%20of%20the%20financial%20terms%20of%20the%20opt-out%20scheme.%20As%20currently%20structured%3ACouncils%20opting%20out%20of%20glyphosate%20treatment%20would%20lose%20associated%20estate%20improvement%20works.%20They%20would%20only%20receive%20funding%20equivalent%20to%20chemical%20treatment%20costs%20%28%C2%A3343.45%20per%20km%29.%20Additional%20costs%20%28alternative%20weed%20management%2C%20waste%20clearance%2C%20liability%20insurance%29%20would%20fall%20locallyThe%20Council%20has%20committed%20to%20reviewing%20and%20decoupling%20this%20arrangement.%F0%9F%8C%B1%20Further%20updates%20will%20follow%20as%20the%20consultation%20process%20progresses.%09%09%09%09","document_date":"2026-04-23T02:43:21+00:00","file_format":"html"},{"key":"standing_orders","label":"Standing orders","statute":"LCAS","found":false,"evidence_url":null,"document_date":null,"file_format":null},{"key":"financial_regulations","label":"Financial regulations","st